<title>ZAMBIA: Zambia September M3 rises 26.7 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Zambia September M3 rises 26.7 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>LUSAKA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zambia's year-on-year broadly defined money supply rose 26.7 percent in September, after a 29.6 percent increase in August, the central bank said.</p>
<p>M3 (kwacha million)</p>
<p>    Sep 1996	  Aug 1996     Sep 1995</p>
<p>    541,705.2	 546,964.2    427,691.5</p>
<p>-- Lusaka newsroom  260-1-222689</p>
